## License Restrictions

- No SSPL / RSAL / Elastic License components are included.
- GPL/AGPL components are used only in "server-side HTTP call" form
  (e.g. SearXNG); they are never statically linked into this project.
- deepDDW and DeepSeek are independent projects. deepDDW is not an official
  DeepSeek product; it simply integrates the official DSH engine.
